			"Message": "chore(deps-dev): Update development dependencies and workflow actions\n\nThis commit updates the development dependencies and GitHub Actions versions to their latest releases:\n\n- Updated `@cloudflare/workers-types` from `4.20251225.0` to `4.20260118.0`\n- Updated `@playform/build` from `0.2.5` to `0.2.6`\n- Updated `actions/cache` from `v5.0.0` to `v5.0.1`\n\nAdditionally, the `--provenance` flag has been removed from the `npm publish` command in the NPM workflow due to compatibility issues with the current publishing setup.\n\nThese changes ensure we're using the latest stable versions of our tooling while maintaining consistent and reliable CI/CD processes.",
